{"id":"n27100-1-8","stage":2,"title":"유머 · 幽默","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27100-1-8-1","ko":"소개팅에서 만난 사람은 어땠어?","zh":"在相亲时认识的那个人怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소개팅에서","meaning":"相亲","explanation":"소개팅：相亲；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"소개팅","audio":"/audio/eeb441c4ef6cc8bc32cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64308","senseId":"1","lemma":"소개팅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소개팅에서","audio":"/audio/efc9fa759b17e812b0ba.mp3"}},{"text":"만난","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만난","audio":"/audio/59a56b665b0716f1d6e1.mp3"}},{"text":"사람은","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람은","audio":"/audio/987448c10afe56108009.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"eeb441c4ef6cc8bc","term":"소개팅","zh":"相亲","audio":"/audio/eeb441c4ef6cc8bc32cf.mp3","entryId":"64308","definition":"在中间介绍男女一对一见面。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/004e4fc7617f46eecfdb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27100-1-8-2","ko":"유머 감각이 나랑 잘 맞아서 마음에 들더라.","zh":"他的幽默感和我很合拍，我挺喜欢的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유머","meaning":"幽默","explanation":"유머：幽默","readings":[{"term":"유머","audio":"/audio/1e46e722c4bb329caba4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27100","senseId":"1","lemma":"유머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유머","audio":"/audio/1e46e722c4bb329caba4.mp3"}},{"text":"감각이","meaning":"感，感知","explanation":"감각：感，感知；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감각","audio":"/audio/004cb195b4004269b6b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15430","senseId":"2","lemma":"감각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감각이","audio":"/audio/9d5f91aff67724c1b572.mp3"}},{"text":"나랑","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나랑","audio":"/audio/ba7570f9b8a80f0e0d15.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"正好，正巧","explanation":"잘：正好，正巧","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"맞아서","meaning":"相称，对，和谐","explanation":"맞다：相称，对，和谐；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"8","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아서","audio":"/audio/585a35eca0344181c422.mp3"}},{"text":"마음에","meaning":"心意，心思","explanation":"마음：心意，心思；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"4","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음에","audio":"/audio/43f69e9e8e24ba2d0d8c.mp3"}},{"text":"들더라.","meaning":"中意，称心，看中","explanation":"들다：中意，称心，看中；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"11","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들더라","audio":"/audio/25da817cabcd8174ae2e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e46e722c4bb329c","term":"유머","zh":"幽默","audio":"/audio/1e46e722c4bb329caba4.mp3","entryId":"27100","definition":"让人发笑的言行。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"004cb195b4004269","term":"감각","zh":"感，感知","audio":"/audio/004cb195b4004269b6b9.mp3","entryId":"15430","definition":"通过对什么的感觉理解而进行判断或表达的能力。","pronunciation":["감ː각"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"正好，正巧","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常适当而合适地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"相称，对，和谐","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"某种行动、意见或状况等与其它对象不违背而相配。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心意，心思","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"喜爱或关心的心情。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"中意，称心，看中","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"觉得某物好。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6629094cd933cb5a314c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27100","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他的幽默感和我很合拍，我挺喜欢的。","新闻里说什么了？","在相亲时认识的那个人怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["他的幽默感和我很合拍，我挺喜欢的。","在相亲时认识的那个人怎么样？","新闻里说什么了？"],"answer":0}]}
